  "ruleText": "Saf-C 1401.04 “Air supported structure” means “air supported structure” as defined in RSA 321-A:1, VII.\n\nSource. #8145, INTERIM, eff 8-25-04, EXPIRED: 2-21-05\n\nNew. #8342, eff 4-28-05, EXPIRED: 1-2-14 (see Revision Note #2 at chapter heading for Saf-C 1400)\n\nNew. #10507, eff 1-21-14, EXPIRED: 1-21-24; renumbered by #12615 (formerly Saf-C 1401.012)\n\nNew. #14011, INTERIM, eff 6-27-24; ss by #14139, eff 11-28-24, EXPIRES: 11-28-34 (formerly Saf-C 1401.013) (see Revision Note #3 at chapter heading for Saf-C 1400)",
